{"symbol":"PATELCHEM","yahoo":"PATELCHEM.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Patel Chem Specialities Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","website":"https://www.patelchem.com","about":"Patel Chem Specialities Limited manufactures and sells cellulose-based excipients. It offers sodium monochloro acetate; BlowTab, a sodium starch glycolate; Disolwell, a croscaremellose sodium; Swellcal, a calcium carboxymethyl cellulose; Rheollose, a sodium carboxymethyl cellulose; and Hindcell, a microcrystalline cellulose. The company also provides PharLub magnesium stearate, AmyloTab C pregelatinized starcg, and sodium chloro acetate. Its products are used in pharmaceutical and nutraceiticals, textile, agriculture, surfactants and detergents, food and beverages, chemicals and polymers, cosmetics and personal care, oil and gas, paper, adhesive, mining, paints, construction, ceramics, and other industries. It also exports its products. The company was formerly known as Patel Chem Specialities Private Limited and changed its name to Patel Chem Specialities Limited. Patel Chem Specialities Limited was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:08:15+00:00","quote":{"price":120.55,"prevClose":114.85,"marketCap":299.81,"high52":115.0,"low52":56.1,"pe":22.74,"bookValue":40.01,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":18.61,"shares":2.487,"insiders":77.61,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-08-01","2025-08-04","2025-08-05","2025-08-06","2025-08-07","2025-08-08","2025-08-11","2025-08-12","2025-08-13","2025-08-14","2025-08-18","2025-08-19","2025-08-20","2025-08-21","2025-08-22","2025-08-25","2025-08-26","2025-08-28","2025-08-29","2025-09-01","2025-09-02","2025-09-03","2025-09-04","2025-09-05","2025-09-08","2025-09-09","2025-09-10","2025-09-11","2025-09-12","2025-09-15","2025-09-16","2025-09-17","2025-09-18","2025-09-19","2025-09-22","2025-09-23","2025-09-24","2025-09-25","2025-09-26","2025-09-29","2025-09-30","2025-10-01","2025-10